{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p001079","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p001079"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p001060","label":"專諸","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"專諸","mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m023-0060","c-shiji-031-wu:m023-0086","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0086","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0120","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0253","c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0304"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m023-0060","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p023","quote":"專諸"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m023-0086","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p023","quote":"專諸"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0086","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"專諸"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0120","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"專諸"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0253","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"專諸"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0304","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"專諸"}]},{"id":"cbr-p001079","label":"專諸子（本卷未名）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0306"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0306","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"子"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0306","start":306,"end":307,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001079","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji031-033","subject_person_id":"cbr-p001079","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"cbr-p001060","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"十二年冬，楚平王卒。十三年春，吳欲因楚喪而伐之，使公子蓋餘、燭庸以兵圍楚之六、灊。使季札於晉，以觀諸侯之變。楚發兵絶吳兵後，吳兵不得還。於是吳公子光曰：「此時不可失也。」告專諸曰：「不索何獲！我眞王嗣，當立，吾欲求之。季子雖至，不吾廢也。」專諸曰：「王僚可殺也。母老子弱，而兩公子將兵攻楚，楚絶其路。方今吳外困於楚，而內空無骨鯁之臣，是無奈我何。」光曰：「我身，子之身也。」四月丙子，光伏甲士於窟室，而謁王僚飲。王僚使兵陳於道，自王宮至光之家，門階戶席，皆王僚之親也，人夾持鈹。公子光詳爲足疾，入於窟室，使專諸置匕首於炙魚之中以進食。手匕首刺王僚，鈹交於匈，遂弑王僚。公子光竟代立爲王，是爲吳王闔廬。闔廬乃以專諸子爲卿。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"只保存本篇明示父母、祖父、兄弟或妃關係；夏史引語保留敘事來源，不補未見姓名、闕代或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji031-008","person_id":"cbr-p001079","title":"卿","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"闔廬乃以專諸子爲卿。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji031-008:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","start":308,"end":309,"surface":"卿","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0306","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","quote":"闔廬乃以專諸子爲卿。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"來源授予、自立與用稱分開；日期只錄原表述，不以死亡自動終止官爵。夫槩自立與闔廬爭位分存，不選唯一合法王號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p024","text":"十二年冬，楚平王卒。十三年春，吳欲因楚喪而伐之，使公子蓋餘、燭庸以兵圍楚之六、灊。使季札於晉，以觀諸侯之變。楚發兵絶吳兵後，吳兵不得還。於是吳公子光曰：「此時不可失也。」告專諸曰：「不索何獲！我眞王嗣，當立，吾欲求之。季子雖至，不吾廢也。」專諸曰：「王僚可殺也。母老子弱，而兩公子將兵攻楚，楚絶其路。方今吳外困於楚，而內空無骨鯁之臣，是無奈我何。」光曰：「我身，子之身也。」四月丙子，光伏甲士於窟室，而謁王僚飲。王僚使兵陳於道，自王宮至光之家，門階戶席，皆王僚之親也，人夾持鈹。公子光詳爲足疾，入於窟室，使專諸置匕首於炙魚之中以進食。手匕首刺王僚，鈹交於匈，遂弑王僚。公子光竟代立爲王，是爲吳王闔廬。闔廬乃以專諸子爲卿。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m024-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface"